    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56519" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κελλῶσαι:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλαγιάσαι</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κελμάς</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεμάς</span>
			, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κελμίς</span></b> , name of
			an Idaean Dactyl, also glossed by <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παῖς ἢ
				λύκιθον</span> (sic), Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κελοί</span></b> , οἱ, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ξύλα</span>
			, Id.
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κελέοντας</span>
			.</div>
